OL,3,AOpenAI agent 'infiltrated' Australian
OL,4,Agovernment website, PM says
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn artificial intelligence agent
OL,7,Fdeveloped by OpenAI "infiltrated" an
OL,8,FAustralian government website in June,
OL,9,FPrime Minister Anthony Albanese has
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FThe agent hacked a statistics portal
OL,13,Fcontaining "non-sensitive" data from
OL,14,FAustralia's universal healthcare scheme
OL,15,FMedicare, Albanese said in New York on
OL,16,FWednesday, local time.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
