OL,3,AOpenAI agent 'infiltrated' Australian
OL,4,Agovernment website, PM says
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe had a "very frank discussion" with
OL,7,FOpenAI CEO Sam Altman for taking "too
OL,8,Flong" to tell them about the breach,
OL,9,Fbelieved to be one of the world's first
OL,10,Fpublicly reported AI-led hacks of a
OL,11,Fgovernment website.
OL,13,FOpenAI said it only became aware of the
OL,14,Fincident in August "during an ongoing
OL,15,Freview" of "misaligned model activity",
OL,16,Fand told Australian officials on 10
OL,17,FSeptember.
